{"path":"regex/sub_match/operator_ltlt","title":"operator<<(std::sub_match)","titleHtml":"operator&lt;&lt;<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(std::sub_match)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/sub_match/operator_ltlt","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"Writes the representation of the matched subsequence m to the output stream os. Equivalent to os << m.str().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> BidirIt <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> sub_match<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes the representation of the matched subsequence <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">m</span></code> to the output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>. \nEquivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> m.<span class=\"me1\">str</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> output stream to write the representation to\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> m\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a sub-match object to output\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;regex&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> sentence<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Quick red fox jumped over a lazy hare.\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/basic_regex\"><span class=\"kw2017\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex</span></span></a> re<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"([A-z]+) ([a-z]+) ([a-z]+)\"</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2027\">std::<span class=\"me2\">smatch</span></span></a> words<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/regex_search\"><span class=\"kw2030\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_search</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>sentence, words, re<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> m <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> words<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"co1\">// m has type `const std::sub_match&lt;std::string::const_iterator&gt;&amp;`</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'['</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> m <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"] \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[Quick red fox] [Quick] [red] [fox]</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/sub_match","title":"std::sub_match"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator<<(std::sub_match)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Writes the representation of the matched subsequence m to the output stream os."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"os, m"},{"label":"Return value","note":"os"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":115,"codeBlockCount":2}
